OL,3,AZara Larsson criticises White House for
OL,4,Ausing her song in deportation video
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwedish pop star Zara Larsson has
OL,7,Fcondemned the White House for using one
OL,8,Fof her most recognisable songs in a
OL,9,Fsocial media reel.
OL,11,FThe clip used Larsson's Midnight Sun in
OL,12,Fa video appearing to show immigration
OL,13,Fenforcement raids. The song has since
OL,14,Fbeen removed from the post, but the
OL,15,Fvideo is still visible on the White
OL,16,FHouse's TikTok feed.
OL,18,FThe video is captioned "never ending
OL,19,Fdeportations", riffing on Larsson's
OL,20,Flyrics "never-ending midnight sun".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
