OL,3,AZara Larsson criticises White House for
OL,4,Ausing her song in deportation video
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a three-minute reaction video posted
OL,7,Fon social media, Larsson described the
OL,8,Fclip as "dehumanising", joining a
OL,9,Fgrowing list of singers, including
OL,10,FSabrina Carpenter and Ariana Grande,
OL,11,Fwho have told the Trump administration
OL,12,Fto not use their music.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
